  Slug: school-of-the-reclamation
  DisplayName: School of the Reclamation
  IconPath: icons/environment/wilderness/tomb-entrance.webp
  Description: "Whether it's been lost to war, abandoned during calamity, or simply
    buried by the ages, there is as much important knowledge to be found in the hidden
    corners of the world as in the schools and libraries of the academy. Your study
    of magic in the service of rediscovering lost knowledge for the Sarkoris Reclamation
    has taught you that much that was once lost can still be found, but only if someone
    is willing to seek it out and retrieve it. You've focused your magic on reaching
    the world's hidden and forgotten places, whether they are found in a distant
    ruin or the depths of a lost memory, and bringing their knowledge back to the
    surface\u2014whatever the cost. Curriculum cantrips: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Telekinetic
    Hand], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Telekinetic Projectile] 1st: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Fleet
    Step], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Gust of Wind], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Mending]
    2nd: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Knock], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Mental
    Map] 3rd: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Locate], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Overwhelming
    Memory] 4th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Bridge of Vines], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Shape
    Stone] 5th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Mind Probe], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Scouting
    Eye] 6th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Truesight], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Wall
    of Force] 7th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Restore Ground], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Retrocognition]
    8th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Pinpoint], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Unrelenting
    Observation] 9th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Metamorphosis] School
    Spells initial: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Grasping Vine]; advanced:
    @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Unsettling Knowledge]"
